# unit_view_scaled_03: unit tests (call) from the start of a Novice race
# for the old view code at 03:B079-B3D9, which nothing in the game calls.
# ScaledOffset ($88 over $8A, base $CE = $1234), data bank $03: $0300 over
# $0040 (shift left, add); -$0300 over $0480 (negate, shift right,
# subtract); 0 (the base alone); $0020 over $0010 (normalise left); $0090
# over $00C0 (the divisor stepped down); $0090 over $0040 (no shift).
# ScaledOffsetPair on $02 = $0500, $08 = $FF00 over $94 = $0200, $D0 =
# $0100. ViewFromAnglesGsu8277 on the race's angles; ViewToGsuParams with
# $1167 clear and set ($1168 = $4321).
